node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-05-15T07:22:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T01:34:39Z","closed_at":"2025-05-19T13:04:24Z","assignee":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.dev4\n- Not reproducible in: v4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev4 - macOS Sequoia (15.4.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running my game in the floating game workspace, it does not receive the `InputEventMouseMotion` input (from a trackpad on a Macbook Pro) but ONLY when `Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED`.\n\nMy code is something like this...\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tInput.set_mouse_mode(Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)\n\n\nfunc _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent):\n       print(event, \" \" , Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)\n\n\tif event.is_action_pressed(\"ui_cancel\"):\n\t\tif Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED:\n\t\t\tInput.set_mouse_mode(Input.MOUSE_MODE_VISIBLE)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tInput.set_mouse_mode(Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)\n\n                get_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n\n\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion and Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED:\n\t\t_handle_mouse_motion(event) # rotate camera, etc.\n                get_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n```\n\nWhen `Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED`, the event is NOT logged at all - almost like it is getting consumed by the viewport somewhere.\n\nWhen `Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_VISIBLE`, for example if I hit Option+Esc to free the mouse, then the event is always logged.\n\nIf I un-check \"Make Game Workspace Floating on Next Play\" so that the game window is embedded in the editor, then the mouse input works as expected without any code changes. This is only specific to the floating game window.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTry to get `InputEventMouseMotion` inside of `_unhandled_input` when using a floating game window on macOS.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI tried to set up an MRP here with this attached to a camera:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node3D\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tInput.set_mouse_mode(Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)\n\n\nfunc _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent):\n\tprint(event)\n\tif event.is_action_pressed(\"ui_cancel\"):\n\t\tif Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED:\n\t\t\tInput.set_mouse_mode(Input.MOUSE_MODE_VISIBLE)\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tInput.set_mouse_mode(Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)\n\t\t\n\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n\n\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion and Input.mouse_mode == Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED:\n\t\trotate_y(-event.relative.x * 0.01)\n\t\t\n\t\tget_viewport().set_input_as_handled()\n```\n\nBut in a basic project, it seems to work just fine in both the floating and embedded viewports. I'm not sure what would be different in my setup - I only read this event in one place.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106431/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}